        "id": "215439774862586810_3",
        "username": "Esenyn",
        "cooked": "<p>Go into your acoount (click on your nickname in the right top side of the steam window) an then  in STORE & PURCHASE HISTORY section go to \"View licenses and product key activations\". Remove EvE Online from the list. After that you will be allowed to buy these packages.</p>",
